<section id="packaging-requirement" data-csrf="<%= csrf %>">
<div class="pr-heading"><div><h1>Material Requirement &amp; Stock Request</h1><p class="muted">Sales Excel ကို Packaging Stock နဲ့ နှိုင်းယှဉ်ပြီး လိုအပ်သော Item များကို Main Warehouse မှ တောင်းရန်။</p></div></div><input id="pr-file" type="file" accept=".xlsx" hidden>
<div class="pr-steps"><button type="button" id="pr-step-import" aria-label="Show Sales Excel upload"><b>1</b><div><strong>Import Sales Excel</strong><small id="pr-source">Online Team ရဲ့ Excel စာရင်း</small></div></button><button type="button" id="pr-step-pending" aria-label="Show Online Pending Quantity"><b>2</b><div><strong>Online Pending Quantity</strong><small id="pr-pending-total">Total Qty: —</small></div></button><article id="pr-step-compare"><b>3</b><div><strong>Compare Packaging Stock</strong><small>နာမည်တူ Qty ပေါင်းပြီး လက်ကျန်နဲ့ နှိုင်းယှဉ်မည်</small></div></article><article><b>4</b><div><strong>Warehouse Request</strong><small>ရွေးထားသော Item များကို တောင်းခံမည်</small></div></article></div>
<p id="pr-message" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
<section id="pr-empty" class="pr-upload-card" aria-labelledby="pr-upload-title">
<div class="pr-upload-intro"><span class="pr-file-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 3h10l7 7v17a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H9a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2Z"/><path d="M19 3v8h7M12 23v-4m5 4v-7m5 7v-10"/></svg></span><h2 id="pr-upload-title">Upload Online Team Sales Order Excel</h2><p>Online Team ရဲ့ Sales Excel ကို ထည့်ပြီး Packaging Warehouse လက်ကျန်နဲ့ နှိုင်းယှဉ်ပါ။</p></div>
<button id="pr-dropzone" class="pr-dropzone" type="button" aria-describedby="pr-upload-limits"><span class="pr-cloud-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 32H12a9 9 0 0 1-1-18 13 13 0 0 1 25-1 9.5 9.5 0 0 1 0 19h-3M24 40V22m-7 7 7-7 7 7"/></svg></span><strong id="pr-drop-caption">Click to upload or drag and drop Excel file here</strong><span id="pr-upload-limits">Excel .xlsx · 5 MB အောက် · Sales row 10,000 အထိ</span><span class="pr-upload-choose">Choose Excel File</span></button>
<details class="pr-format-notes"><summary>Excel format နှင့် Import စည်းမျဉ်းများ</summary><p>Order Lines/Product နှင့် Order Lines/Product Qty column များ ပါဝင်ရပါမည်။ SR နံပါတ် မပါသော အောက်ဆက်ကြောင်းများပါ Qty ပေါင်းမည်။ Deli / Deli Fee များကို မတွက်ပါ။ မူရင်း Excel ဖိုင်ကို Server မှာ မသိမ်းပါ။</p></details>
</section>
<section id="pr-preview" class="pr-sales-preview pr-pending-screen" hidden><div class="pr-preview-heading"><h2>Online Pending Quantity</h2><button id="pr-pending-export" type="button" class="pr-button pr-secondary">↓ Download Excel</button></div><div class="pr-table-wrap"><table class="pr-table"><thead><tr><th>No.</th><th>Product / No.</th><th>Online Pending Qty</th></tr></thead><tbody id="pr-preview-rows"></tbody></table></div><div class="pr-upload-bottom"><button id="pr-compare" type="button" disabled>Compare Packaging Stock <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div></section>
<div id="pr-result" hidden><div class="pr-stats"><article><span>Imported Sales Qty</span><strong id="pr-sales">0</strong><small id="pr-distinct">0 items</small></article><article><span>Sufficient In-Hand</span><strong id="pr-sufficient">0</strong><small>လက်ကျန်လုံလောက်သော Items</small></article><article class="pr-shortage-card"><span>To Request from Warehouse</span><strong id="pr-shortage">0</strong><small>လိုအပ်သော Items</small></article><article><span>Items to Check</span><strong id="pr-unmatched">0</strong><small>နာမည်မတွေ့ / နာမည်တူတစ်ခုထက်ပိုရှိ</small></article></div>
<div class="pr-toolbar"><div class="pr-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Compare status"><button type="button" data-status="" aria-pressed="true">All Items</button><button type="button" data-status="SHORTAGE" aria-pressed="false">Shortage</button><button type="button" data-status="SUFFICIENT" aria-pressed="false">Sufficient</button><button type="button" data-status="ERROR" aria-pressed="false">Items to Check</button></div><input id="pr-search" type="search" maxlength="100" placeholder="Search Item Code / Item Name…" aria-label="Search comparison"><button id="pr-refresh" type="button">↻ Refresh Stock</button></div>
<p class="pr-note" id="pr-import-note"></p><p class="pr-note">နာမည်မကိုက်သော Item များကို Excel တွင် ပြင်ပြီး ပြန် Import လုပ်ပါ။ ထို Item များကို Request ထဲ မထည့်နိုင်ပါ။ Request တင်ရုံဖြင့် Stock မပြောင်းပါ။</p>
<div class="pr-table-wrap pr-comparison-table"><table class="pr-table"><thead><tr><th><input id="pr-select-all" type="checkbox" aria-label="Select all visible shortage items"></th><th>Product / Item Code</th><th>Sales Qty</th><th>Packaging Stock</th><th>Shortage Qty</th><th>Status</th><th>Request Qty</th></tr></thead><tbody id="pr-rows"></tbody></table><p id="pr-no-match" class="pr-note" hidden>ကိုက်ညီသော Item မရှိပါ။</p></div>
<footer class="pr-request-footer"><div><strong id="pr-selected">0 items selected</strong><small id="pr-selected-qty">Total Request Qty: 0</small></div><div class="pr-footer-tools"><button type="button" id="pr-export" class="pr-secondary">↓ Export Excel</button><button type="button" id="pr-submit" disabled>Request from Warehouse</button></div></footer></div>
</section>
